cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GnLblvJHy2oQ7kNvwEgjGpn&_nc_oc=AdrU5XmcJyQyA5jbVnMzGBN6UkB4MHH1wsms-E-agYaTjahKyVYVVtbir7AhVnjz_F8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6xnECMTm2Jgqh0VEXJ2zSrSPtwkDNvLXFY0OCEWJJfTA&oe=6A05C084"}, "display_name": "Medify VR", "keywords": ["OrthopedicSurgery", "MedicalTraining", "VirtualReality", "SurgicalSimulation", "IALearning"], "long_description": "Medify VR \u2013 Immersive Orthopedic Surgery Training\n\nMedify VR is an immersive virtual reality simulation that revolutionizes the way orthopedic surgery is learned. Combining AI-driven guidance with realistic interactive scenarios, Medify VR allows medical students and professionals to practice surgical procedures safely and gain hands-on experience without risk to patients.\n\nKey Features\n\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Hands-on Practice: Master surgical tools\u2014from clamps to saws\u2014in a high-fidelity environment.\n\n\ud83e\udde0 Deep Immersion: Navigate realistic patient journeys where every diagnostic choice matters.\n\n\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Meet Your AI Guide: Train alongside Al-Zahrawi. Whether you need a quick tip or a deep dive into a procedure, our AI persona provides expert guidance at every turn.\n\n\ud83d\udcc8 Performance Analytics: Get instant feedback on your accuracy, speed, and technique with our intelligent grading system.\n\nMedify VR transforms theoretical knowledge into practical expertise, bridging the gap between classroom learning and real-life surgery.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Experience the future of medical training \u2013 anytime, anywhere, in VR.", "short_description": "Medify VR is an immersive virtual reality simulation that transforms orthopedic surgery training through AI-driven, realistic interactive scenarios."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/faouez12/policies/blob/main/policies", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Epic Valor X", "support_website_url": nul